Review comment:

- [P2] Reset fitted text size before each fit pass — /Users/asmirnou/Projects/g/ramsider/components/TechnologyDescriptions.tsx:18-28
  When a CyberMind slide changes between locales or fonts finish loading, `TextBlock` can reuse an element whose font size was reduced by an earlier fit. The fit loop only checks whether the text fits; it never restores the requested size before measuring, so shorter replacement copy can remain unnecessarily small. Reset the element to its requested size before each fit pass, including the `document.fonts.ready` pass.
